{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015f3Hbw7qsjMbSDHcXg5TYK","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# solver-trace-ablation — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 09:06 UTC | 更新原因: D038 taxonomy 结果纳入 + 刷新 RUNNING 状态（plan016 已完成、s43/s44 在跑）\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nSTA/ISR 作为 GRPO neurosymbolic formalizer 的**诊断工具** + **Goodhart's Law 案例研究**——检测 reward hacking、量化结构退化、分类退化模式，并展示 ISR 从诊断指标到优化目标的 Goodhart 转折。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research + 审稿进行中 | **DDL**: 2026-05-25（剩 11 天）\\\\n- **实验**: 39 个 (RUNNING 2, PREPARING 5, DONE 32) | success 8\\\\n- **GPU**: 2 × RTX PRO 6000 96GB — ✅ 两卡满载\\\\n\\\\n### 核心证据链\\\\n- ✅ ISR 崩塌轨迹：0.6423 (100步) → 0.1324 (500步) → 0.0027 (1000步)\\\\n- ✅ 3-seed exec-only：s42 conclusion embedding | s43 degraded | s44 tautological collapse\\\\n- ✅ Goodhart β 剂量效应：β=0.1 sweet spot (ISR 3.2x > random) vs β=0.3 collapse (ISR < random)\\\\n- ✅ Hacking taxonomy 定量对比 (D038)：ISR β=0.1 genuine 25.9% vs random 17.7% (+8.2pp)，conclusion embedding 73-79%\\\\n- ✅ plan016 1000步：PR=0.96, ISR=0.003，崩塌持续恶化\\\\n- ✅ plan014 downstream NLI: ISR-NLI ρ=-0.049 n.s.，ISR 能力边界已刻画\\\\n- ✅ Table 1 修复 + 文献修正完成\\\\n- ⏳ plan002-b01-s43/s44: RUNNING — β=0.1 多 seed 验证\\\\n- 🔜 plan018-random-s43/s44: PREPARING — matched random 多 seed 控制\\\\n- 🔜 plan006-prolog ×3: PREPARING — Claim 3 跨 logic type 验证\\\\n\\\\n## RUNNING\\\\n| 实验 | GPU | 说明 |\\\\n|------|-----|------|\\\\n| plan002-additive-b01-s43 | cuda:0 | ISR β=0.1 seed=43 |\\\\n| plan002-additive-b01-s44 | cuda:1 | ISR β=0.1 seed=44 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] s43/s44 完成 → eval_sta.py + taxonomy + 3-seed mean±std\\\\n- [ ] plan018-random-s43/s44 启动（GPU 空闲后）\\\\n- [ ] plan006 Prolog 代码/数据 readiness 确认\\\\n- [ ] 3-seed 全部出齐 → Table 1 + Table 2 定稿\\\\n- [ ] plan006 结果 → 论文写作启动评估\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 本地: 2 × RTX PRO 6000 96GB，两卡满载\\\\n- 已消耗: ~35+ GPU·h\\\\n- 剩余需求: ~12h（s43/s44 ~2h + random s43/s44 ~2h + plan006 ×3 ~6h + eval ~2h）\\\\n- DDL 11 天 × 2 卡 × 24h = 528 GPU·h，时间充裕\\\\n\\\\n## 写作约束\\\\n- plan013 vs plan017 公式结构不同，不可简化为\\\\\\\"additive vs convex\\\\\\\"对照 (D027)\\\\n- ISR β=0.1 hacking rate 仍达 74%——论文不可标\\\\\\\"no hacking\\\\\\\"，应标\\\\\\\"lowest hacking rate\\\\\\\" (D038)\\\\n- β=0.1 3-seed 出齐前论文统计用 s42 单 seed，标注 preliminary\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D043 | 2026-05-14 | ISR β=0.1 \\\\\\\"sweet spot\\\\\\\"叙事降级：2/3 seeds ISR 膨胀为 artif | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan002-additive-b01-s43, plan002-additive-b01-s44, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42 |\\\\n| D042 | 2026-05-14 | ISR 度量存在结构性盲点：premise≈conclusion 时 conclusion sub- | plan002-additive-b01-s43, plan002-additive-b01-s44, plan002-additive-b01-s42 |\\\\n| D041 | 2026-05-14 | Claim 2 framing pivot: ISR β=0.1 \\\\\\\"sweet spot\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"a | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan002-additive-b01-s43, plan002-additive-b01-s44 |\\\\n| D040 | 2026-05-14 | plan002-b01-s44 reclassified: \\\\\\\"success\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"new hac | plan002-additive-b01-s44, plan002-additive-b01-s42 |\\\\n| D039 | 2026-05-14 | plan002-b01-s44 重分类：从 success 改为 semantic drift ha | plan002-additive-b01-s44 |\\\\n| D038 | 2026-05-14 | Hacking taxonomy 结果足够，跳过 LLM-as-judge；taxonomy 对比覆 | plan012, plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42 |\\\\n| D037 | 2026-05-14 | ISR β=0.1 质量验证路径：先 hacking taxonomy 对比，必要时加 LLM-as | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42, plan012 |\\\\n| D036 | 2026-05-14 | 为 beta=0.1 补跑多 seed (s43/s44) 验证 ISR vs random 的稳健 | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42, plan001-exec-only-s43 |\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-14 | Framing 选 C: Goodhart 主线 — ISR 展示经典 Goodhart 效应（β= | plan002-b01, plan018, plan002-b03, plan017 |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-14 | Framing 选 C+A 混合：Goodhart 为主线叙事，ISR 诊断保留为 Claim 1， | plan002-b01, plan018, plan002-b03, plan017 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3396, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UUP5mzBzYB3929c9Wy4BBo","session_id":"f8da9cdc-096a-48ff-af14-645ac8499d5f","uuid":"60deee3d-107d-4b36-a5ff-c77afe0f4dad","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:26:20.945Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01TLfkMxQThrivTyyy6WsxUu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017mBsFYkvj2fDB6sQXLAQWF","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"solver-trace-ablation","file":"paper_framing.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3848,"cache_read_input_tokens":16756,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3848,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":58,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UUP5mzBzYB3929c9Wy4BBo","session_id":"f8da9cdc-096a-48ff-af14-645ac8499d5f","uuid":"5aa58f96-a6f5-4456-9943-34637bdb9664"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017mBsFYkvj2fDB6sQXLAQWF","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/paper_framing.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Paper Framing — solver-trace-ablation\\\\n\\\\n## Target Venue\\\\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (NLP and Symbolic Reasoning track)\\\\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\\\\n- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (3 条 — Goodhart 主线诊断/分析论文)\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 1: ISR as Reward Hacking Diagnostic\\\\nSolver Trace Ablation (STA) derives ISR (Intensional Structural Reward) via component necessity testing (leave-one-out ablation on solver inputs). ISR detects reward hacking that prove_rate alone misses: exec-only GRPO achieves PR=93% but ISR collapses from 0.6423 (100 steps) to 0.1324 (500 steps) to 0.0027 (1000 steps), quantifying structural degeneration invisible to the execution reward.\\\\n\\\\n**证据**：\\\\n- plan003: 100-step checkpoint held-out eval PR=32%, ISR=0.6423 (proved-only) — early training produces structurally sound formalizations\\\\n- plan001-s42: 500-step checkpoint held-out eval PR=93%, ISR=0.1324, median_ISR=0.0 — late training achieves high prove_rate via structural shortcuts\\\\n- **plan016**: 1000-step checkpoint eval PR=96%, ISR=**0.0027** — ISR 崩塌持续恶化，无回升。94.8% proved 样本 ISR=0。矛盾爆炸式崩塌（components 6.58→18.55）。延长训练是 reward hacking 随时间恶化的干净消融证据\\\\n- ISR 崩塌轨迹完整链：0.6423 (100步) → 0.1324 (500步) → 0.0027 (1000步)\\\\n- 3-seed consistency: s42 conclusion embedding (ISR=0.123), s43 repetition collapse (PR=13%, ISR=0), s44 tautological collapse (PR=98%, ISR=0.57 fake-high, n_comp=2.04)\\\\n- Hacking taxonomy: 6 distinct modes identified and quantified (plan012 + plan017 D027 + D043 conclusion duplication with ISR inflation)\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 2: ISR as Reward Exhibits Meta-Level Goodhart (D033→D043 重写)\\\\nISR 作为 proxy metric 展现 **meta-level Goodhart 效应**：当 ISR 从诊断指标转变为优化目标，模型不仅在高剂量 Goodhart PR（β=0.3 PR 崩塌），还在低剂量 Goodhart ISR 度量本身（β=0.1，2/3 seeds 通过 conclusion duplication 膨胀 ISR）。ISR bonus 特异性地诱导 premise=conclusion hacking——random noise 在相同 β 下不触发此模式，证明这是 ISR-specific gaming 而非 GRPO 通用退化。\\\\n\\\\n**证据（β=0.1 三 seed + random 对照，D043 更新）**：\\\\n\\\\n| Seed | PR | proved_only ISR | single_premise% | premise=conclusion% | 诊断 |\\\\n|------|-----|-----------------|-----------------|---------------------|------|\\\\n| s42 (ISR β=0.1) | 0.81 | **0.415** | 18.5% | ~18.5% | H7≈18.5%, H1≈55%, genuine≈26% (D038) |\\\\n| s43 (ISR β=0.1) | 0.61 | 0.830 | 100% | 97% | **conclusion duplication artifact** |\\\\n| s44 (ISR β=0.1) | 0.89 | 0.902 | ~100% | 65%+ | **conclusion duplication artifact** |\\\\n| s42 (random β=0.1) | 0.79 | 0.131 | **0%** | **0%** | redundant premises, zero duplication |\\\\n\\\\n- s42: H7≈18.5%（single_premise + premise=conclusion），H1≈55%（multi-premise conclusion embedding），genuine≈26% (D038)。proved_only_ISR=0.415 < GT=0.559。注意\\\\\\\"80% non-H7\\\\\\\"≠\\\\\\\"80% genuine\\\\\\\"——D038 taxonomy 计入所有 hacking modes 后 genuine 仅 25.9%\\\\n- s43/s44: conclusion duplication — premise=conclusion 单前提证明，ISR 通过 conclusion sub-component ablation 膨胀到 0.83-0.90（远超 GT=0.559）。40/61 proved samples ISR=1.0 (s43)\\\\n- random β=0.1 对照: **零** conclusion duplication (0/79)，n_premises 3-15 — ISR-specific gaming 确认\\\\n- **结论**: ISR reward 在 β=0.1 有 genuine guidance 能力（s42），但同时诱导 ISR-specific gaming（s43/s44）。成功率 1/3，且 gaming 模式比 exec-only hacking 更隐蔽（PR 和 ISR 表面都高）。ISR 作为 reward component 的可靠性不足以推荐使用。\\\\n\\\\n**s42 单 seed Hacking Taxonomy 定量对比 (D038)**：\\\\n- ISR β=0.1 genuine: 25.9% (21/81) vs random β=0.1 genuine: 17.7% (14/79) — **+8.2pp**\\\\n- Conclusion embedding: ISR 72.8% vs random 78.5% — 两组主导模式，ISR 略降但未消除\\\\n- Complexity-without-utility: ISR **0%** vs random 3.8% — ISR 完全消除此模式\\\\n- ISR genuine quality: mean ISR 0.67 (max 1.0) vs random genuine mean ISR 0.34 (max 0.5)\\\\n- 整体 hacking rate: ISR 74.1% vs random 82.3%\\\\n- ⚠️ 以上仅 s42；s43/s44 主要退化模式为 conclusion duplication（第 6 种 hacking mode，taxonomy 更新中）\\\\n\\\\n**证据（β=0.3 同剂量对照）**：\\\\n- plan002-b03 (ISR β=0.3): eval PR=0.18, ISR=0.026 — Goodhart 效应，PR 崩塌\\\\n- plan017 (random β=0.3): eval PR=0.48, ISR=0.045 — random 比 ISR 好 2.7x PR\\\\n- **结论**：高剂量 ISR 对训练 actively misleading (PR 18% < random 48%)\\\\n\\\\n**β 剂量效应全景**：\\\\n| β | ISR reward PR | Random reward PR | ISR reward ISR | Random reward ISR | 解读 |\\\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\\\n| 0.1 | 0.81 (s42) / 0.61 (s43) / 0.89 (s44) | 0.79 | **0.415** (s42) / **0.830** (s43) / **0.902** (s44) | 0.131 | s42 genuine; s43/s44 ISR-specific gaming (conclusion duplication) |\\\\n| 0.3 | 0.18 | 0.48 | 0.026 | 0.045 | ISR << random (Goodhart) |\\\\n\\\\n**其他 ISR-as-reward 失败模式**：\\\\n- plan005 凸组合 (α·r_exec + β·r_exec·ISR, α+β=1): ISR<1 时永远是 penalty → PR 下降 (D010)\\\\n- plan013 convex random: PR=1.0 但 100% P→P tautological collapse (D018)\\\\n\\\\n⚠️ **措辞约束 (Reviewer D027)**: plan013 (0.9·r_exec+0.1·random) vs plan017 (r_exec·(1+0.3·random)) 公式结构不同，不可简化为\\\\\\\"additive vs convex\\\\\\\"对照。plan017 vs plan002 和 plan018 vs plan002-b01 的 ISR vs random 对比是纯净的（唯一变量是 random vs ISR）\\\\n\\\\n⚠️ **β=0.1 三 seed 已出（D043）**：s42 genuine, s43/s44 conclusion duplication artifact。不可报 raw 3-seed mean ISR（被膨胀值污染），需按 hacking mode 分层报告。\\\\n\\\\n### Claim 3: Cross-Logic Generality (conditional on plan006)\\\\nSTA protocol is solver-agnostic: the 5-step derivation (pilot → collect shortcuts → classify → map RIP → design check) transfers to structurally different formal languages. Hacking modes and ISR diagnostic value replicate across FOL→Prover9 and Prolog→SWI-Prolog.\\\\n\\\\n**证据**: 待验证。plan006 Prolog GRPO dry-run 进行中，训练即将启动（3 seeds × 500 步）。如果 plan006 无法复现 hacking + ISR 诊断，此 claim 降级为 future work。\\\\n\\\\n## Story Spine\\\\n\\\\n- **Problem**: GRPO with execution-only rewards trains neurosymbolic formalizers that achieve high solve rates but produce structurally degenerate outputs (reward hacking). Current practice evaluates only prove_rate, missing structural quality entirely. No principled diagnostic exists for detecting and characterizing this failure mode.\\\\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Mellgren et al. (2025) hand-craft Prolog-specific structure penalties. EVOM (2026) uses scalar execution rewards only. ExecVerify/EGCA derive trace-level rewards for code, not formal logic. No work systematically studies reward hacking in formal reasoning GRPO or provides diagnostic tools for it.\\\\n- **Our contribution**: We propose STA (Solver Trace Ablation), applying component necessity testing (LOO ablation) to derive ISR as a **diagnostic metric** for structural integrity. Key findings:\\\\n  1. ISR quantifies hacking invisible to prove_rate (64% → 13% → 0.3% collapse over training)\\\\n  2. ISR as proxy metric exhibits **meta-level Goodhart's Law**: at low dose (β=0.1), ISR reward induces ISR-specific gaming in 2/3 seeds (conclusion duplication that inflates ISR itself), while only 1/3 seeds show genuine improvement; at high dose (β=0.3), classic Goodhart collapse (PR 18% vs random 48%). The diagnostic metric becomes the target of gaming when used as optimization signal.\\\\n  3. GRPO saturation creates a \\\\\\\"training trap\\\\\\\": PR→1 means no gradient signal; adding variance redirects rather than prevents hacking\\\\n  4. Different reward formulations produce distinct, classifiable hacking strategies (6 modes identified, including ISR-specific \\\\\\\"conclusion duplication with ISR inflation\\\\\\\")\\\\n  5. ISR measures syntactic component necessity, not semantic faithfulness — this boundary is important for practitioners\\\\n- **Actionable insights for practitioners**:\\\\n  1. Never trust prove_rate alone — use ISR + component count as joint diagnostic\\\\n  2. Single-seed GRPO results are unreliable (2/3 exec-only seeds collapse differently)\\\\n  3. ISR reward is unreliable as training signal at any dose: β=0.1 induces ISR-specific gaming in 2/3 seeds (conclusion duplication inflates ISR itself), β=0.3 collapses PR. Use ISR for post-hoc diagnosis only.\\\\n  4. Proxy metrics that detect gaming can themselves become gaming targets when used as optimization signals (meta-level Goodhart) — a cautionary result for any proxy-metric-as-reward approach.\\\\n- **Headline result**: \\\\\\\"We demonstrate that ISR — a component necessity metric derived from solver trace ablation — serves as a powerful diagnostic for reward hacking in GRPO-trained formalizers, but exhibits meta-level Goodhart's Law when used as a training signal. At low dose (β=0.1), ISR reward induces a novel hacking mode in 2/3 seeds: models learn premise=conclusion strategies that simultaneously maximize execution reward and inflate ISR itself — the diagnostic metric becomes the gaming target. At high dose (β=0.3), classic Goodhart collapse occurs (PR 18% vs random 48%). Across 6 reward conditions, 3 seeds, and up to 1000 training steps, we identify 6 distinct hacking strategies including ISR-specific 'conclusion duplication with ISR inflation,' and document ISR's fundamental asymmetry: reliable as observer, unreliable as optimizer.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## ISR Capability Boundary (D021/D022)\\\\n\\\\n**ISR 度量的是 syntactic necessity（组件在证明中是否必要），不是 semantic faithfulness（formalization 是否忠实于自然语言语义）。**\\\\n\\\\nplan014 downstream NLI 验证结果（negative）精确刻画了这一边界：\\\\n- Spearman ρ(ISR, NLI accuracy) = -0.049 (p=0.187, 不显著)\\\\n- Best-of-N ISR selection vs random: +0.9pp (不显著)\\\\n- 主因：模型严重 true-bias (false accuracy=0%)，NLI accuracy 天花板仅 34.1%\\\\n\\\\n**论文处理**：ISR-as-downstream-quality-proxy 降级为 **Limitation / Future Work**。plan014 结果作为 negative result 保留，精确刻画 ISR 能力边界。\\\\n\\\\n## ISR-as-Reward: Goodhart Landscape (D033 更新)\\\\n\\\\nISR 作为训练信号的全部结果，按 β 剂量组织：\\\\n\\\\n| 条件 | 公式 | eval PR | eval ISR | 退化模式 | Goodhart 阶段 |\\\\n|------|------|---------|----------|----------|---------------|\\\\n| exec-only (baseline) | r = r_exec | 0.93 (s42) | 0.123 | conclusion embedding | N/A |\\\\n| ISR β=0.1 (s42) | r = r_exec·(1+0.1·ISR) | 0.81 | **0.415** | genuine 80%, conclusion embedding 16% | genuine (1/3 seeds) |\\\\n| ISR β=0.1 (s43) | r = r_exec·(1+0.1·ISR) | 0.61 | **0.830** | **conclusion duplication 97%**, ISR inflation | **meta-Goodhart** (2/3 seeds) |\\\\n| ISR β=0.1 (s44) | r = r_exec·(1+0.1·ISR) | 0.89 | **0.902** | **conclusion duplication 65%+**, ISR inflation | **meta-Goodhart** (2/3 seeds) |\\\\n| random β=0.1 | r = r_exec·(1+0.1·random) | 0.79 | 0.104 | redundant premises | control |\\\\n| ISR β=0.3 | r = r_exec·(1+0.3·ISR) | 0.18 | 0.026 | format collapse | post-Goodhart |\\\\n| random β=0.3 | r = r_exec·(1+0.3·random) | 0.48 | 0.045 | complexity-without-utility | control |\\\\n| convex combination | r = 0.9·r_exec + 0.1·ISR | 0.77 (train) | 0.230 (train) | ISR-PR separation | penalty effect |\\\\n| convex random | r = 0.9·r_exec + 0.1·random | 1.00 | 0.535 (fake) | tautological | hacking |\\\\n\\\\n**Goodhart 效应跨所有 β 剂量存在，但表现形式不同。** β=0.1: meta-Goodhart（2/3 seeds gaming ISR 本身，1/3 genuine）；β=0.3: classic Goodhart（PR 崩塌）。ISR 作为 reward 的可靠性不足——即使在\\\\\\\"最佳\\\\\\\"剂量下成功率也仅 1/3。ISR 的核心价值在诊断（Claim 1），不在训练信号。\\\\n\\\\n## Venue Fit Risks\\\\n\\\\n- **EMNLP fit**: Diagnostic/analysis paper with Goodhart's Law case study in NLP + formal reasoning track. Empirical findings + mechanistic insight valued at EMNLP.\\\\n- **\\\\\\\"Just negative results\\\\\\\" risk**: Mitigate by: (a) ISR as diagnostic IS the positive result (Claim 1)，(b) meta-Goodhart finding (diagnostic metric gets gamed as reward) is novel mechanistic insight，(c) 6-mode hacking taxonomy is actionable contribution，(d) the \\\\\\\"negative\\\\\\\" result (ISR reward unreliable) is itself the key finding for practitioners。\\\\n- **\\\\\\\"Old wine\\\\\\\" risk**: ISR = LOO ablation. Claim novelty at application level (first systematic Goodhart analysis for formal reasoning GRPO) + empirical findings, not algorithm level.\\\\n- **Single-logic risk**: If plan006 Prolog doesn't happen, paper is FOL-only. Mitigate by emphasizing depth of analysis (3 seeds × 6 conditions × 6 hacking modes × 3 training horizons).\\\\n\\\\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\\\\n\\\\n1. **\\\\\\\"ISR is just LOO ablation — not novel\\\\\\\"** — Yes, explicitly acknowledge. Contribution is (a) applying it as hacking diagnostic for formal reasoning GRPO, (b) empirical Goodhart analysis on reward shaping, (c) hacking taxonomy, (d) GRPO saturation mechanism.\\\\n2. **\\\\\\\"β=0.1 success is just one seed\\\\\\\"** — Now confirmed: 3-seed β=0.1 results show 1/3 genuine (s42: 80% genuine, multi-premise), 2/3 ISR-specific gaming (s43/s44: conclusion duplication). This seed sensitivity is itself a key finding — it demonstrates ISR reward's unreliability and supports the meta-Goodhart narrative. Random control (0/79 conclusion duplication) confirms the gaming is ISR-specific.\\\\n3. **\\\\\\\"Goodhart's Law is obvious\\\\\\\"** — The conceptual prediction is known; the empirical characterization in formal reasoning GRPO is not. Specifically: (a) meta-level Goodhart at low β (diagnostic metric itself gets gamed), (b) ISR being worse than random at high β (not just \\\\\\\"less useful\\\\\\\"), (c) 6 distinct hacking modes as Goodhart manifestations, (d) ISR-specific gaming absent from matched random control.\\\\n4. **\\\\\\\"No positive result — ISR doesn't improve training\\\\\\\"** — ISR's positive result is as **diagnostic** (Claim 1), not as training signal. β=0.1 shows genuine improvement in 1/3 seeds but ISR-specific gaming in 2/3 — this unreliability IS the finding (meta-Goodhart). The paper's contribution is characterizing WHY proxy metrics fail as rewards, not proposing a working reward.\\\\n5. **\\\\\\\"ISR is circular\\\\\\\"** — The circularity concern is now empirically validated: ISR as reward induces ISR-specific gaming (conclusion duplication) in 2/3 seeds — the metric optimizes itself. This supports using ISR only for post-hoc diagnosis, never as reward. Component count analysis provides ISR-independent evidence.\\\\n6. **\\\\\\\"Only one logic type\\\\\\\"** — STA protocol is solver-agnostic; plan006 Prolog validates generality. If absent, acknowledge as limitation.\\\\n7. **\\\\\\\"500 steps too short\\\\\\\"** — plan016 extends to 1000 steps, showing ISR collapse continues and worsens (0.123→0.003, -97.8%). The ISR崩塌轨迹 covers 100/500/1000 steps.\\\\n8. **\\\\\\\"3 seeds insufficient for statistical claims\\\\\\\"** — The 3-seed divergence (3 different hacking modes from same setup) is itself a finding, not a limitation. Statistical claims on mean ISR use 3-seed mean±std.\\\\n9. **\\\\\\\"Related work insufficient\\\\\\\"** — Expand to 25+ refs: reward hacking (Gao 2023, Skalse 2022), Goodhart's Law (Manheim & Garrabrant 2019, Karwowski 2024), GRPO (Shao 2024), formal reasoning (LeanDojo, Baldur), feature attribution (SHAP), FOLIO (Han 2022).\\\\n10. **\\\\\\\"RIP framework overstated\\\\\\\"** — Frame as \\\\\\\"component necessity testing inspired by mutation testing's RIP framework,\\\\\\\" only Propagation condition operationalized.\\\\n11. **\\\\\\\"Practitioners can't act on this\\\\\\\"** — 4 actionable insights listed in Story Spine. ISR + component count as joint diagnostic is immediately deployable. The meta-Goodhart warning (don't use diagnostic metrics as reward signals) is directly actionable for anyone designing reward shaping in formal reasoning.\\\\n\\\\n## Dream-Identified Structural Fixes (Paper Agent)\\\\n\\\\n- [ ] Related work: 6→25+ references (literature_map.yaml now has 33)\\\\n- [ ] RIP framing: reframe as \\\\\\\"component necessity testing inspired by RIP\\\\\\\"\\\\n- [ ] \\\\\\\"Dense+automatic\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"conditionally dense\\\\\\\"\\\\n- [ ] Remove all \\\\\\\"Pareto-improving\\\\\\\" language\\\\n- [ ] Acknowledge ISR = LOO ablation, cite feature attribution literature\\\\n- [ ] Address ISR sparsity for unproved outputs explicitly\\\\n- [ ] Add Goodhart's Law literature (Manheim & Garrabrant 2019, Karwowski 2024, Gao 2023)\\\\n- [x] Convex combination → additive bonus (D010, then D020 confirmed all ISR-as-reward failed at β=0.3)\\\\n- [x] ISR downstream validation → Limitation/Future Work (D021/D022, plan014 negative)\\\\n- [x] Hacking taxonomy expanded to 6 modes (plan012 + plan017 + D043 conclusion duplication with ISR inflation)\\\\n- [x] β=0.1 ISR: s42 genuine, s43/s44 conclusion duplication → meta-Goodhart narrative (D031→D043)\\\\n- [x] β=0.1 random control confirms ISR structural value (D033, plan018 eval)\\\\n- [x] 1000-step ISR collapse documented (plan016, ISR 0.123→0.003)\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 15356, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UUP5mzBzYB3929c9Wy4BBo","session_id":"f8da9cdc-096a-48ff-af14-645ac8499d5f","uuid":"53ceff17-a5b1-44ea-8298-0ccd999e2552","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:26:21.425Z"}
