3 下是否可复现？exec-only s43 是 degraded seed (PR=14%)，ISR β=0.1 能否拯救 bad seed？3-seed mean±std 用于论文 Claim 2 统计支撑。 ← 基于 plan002-additive-b01-s42\\\\n  [plan002-b01-s43-eval-results](/api/workspace-files/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/plan002-additive-b01-s43/data/plan002-b01-s43-eval-pointer.txt)\\\\n- **plan002-additive-b01-s44** (negative): ISR β=0.1 seed=44 多 seed 验证：exec-only s44 是 tautological collapse (PR=98%, ISR=0.57 fake)，ISR β=0.1 能否防止 tautological collapse？3-seed mean±std 用于论文 Claim 2。 ← 基于 plan002-additive-b01-s42\\\\n- **plan012-hacking-taxonomy** (success): ISR β=0.1 vs Random β=0.1 hacking taxonomy 对比：ISR reward 能否减少 hacking 模式比例、增加 genuine proof 比例？5 种 hacking 分类（conclusion embedding, repetition collapse, tautological collapse, complexity-without-utility, premise padding）。\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 9 / 负向 12 / 失败 14 / 共 35\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-39279: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-only: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-sta: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-only-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-sta-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-only-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-sta-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s42-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s43: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan013-random-reward-s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan013-random-reward-s42-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s43-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan013-random-reward-s42-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s43-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3095, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dcf33VCz6gsQyTv4BYFvp6","session_id":"f8da9cdc-096a-48ff-af14-645ac8499d5f","uuid":"113216bd-ef52-48cb-a2e1-ea2bed73a222","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:26:43.567Z"}
