0.48, ISR=0.094\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: β=0.1 ISR success 暂不改 framing，先跑 β=0.1 random matched control\\\\n  rationale: plan002-b01 (β=0.1) PR=0.81/ISR=0.415 是重大正面结果，但 Reviewer 正确指出：缺 β=0.1\\\\n    random control 无法区分\\\\\\\"ISR structural signal\\\\\\\"和\\\\\\\"low-dose regularization effect\\\\\\\"。β=0.3\\\\n    有 matched random (plan017)，β=0.1 没有。在 control 结果出来前修改 framing 是冒进的——如果 β=0.1 random\\\\n    也给高 ISR，则 ISR 无特殊价值。Control 仅需 ~1h GPU，成本极低。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-b01\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: success, PR=0.81, ISR=0.415\\\\n  - exp_id: plan017\\\\n    role: precedent\\\\n    result: β=0.3 random control, PR=0.48\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: Framing 升级为 Goodhart 主线：ISR 在低剂量(β=0.1)有效、高剂量(β=0.3)崩溃，统一用 Goodhart's Law\\\\n    解释\\\\n  rationale: plan018 eval 确认 ISR β=0.1 结构价值真实（ISR 3.2x > random control，PR 持平）。β=0.3\\\\n    下 ISR < random 是 Goodhart 过度优化。统一叙事：ISR 作为 proxy metric 遵循 Goodhart's Law —— diagnostic\\\\n    有价值 (Claim 1)、低剂量优化有效、高剂量导致 Goodhart 崩溃。覆盖所有实验结果且有理论锚点。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-b01\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: 'ISR β=0.1: PR=0.81, ISR=0.415'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan018\\\\n    role: matched_control\\\\n    result: 'random β=0.1: PR=0.79, ISR=0.104, confirms ISR signal genuine'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-b03\\\\n    role: high_dose\\\\n    result: 'ISR β=0.3: PR=0.18, Goodhart collapse'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan017\\\\n    role: high_dose_control\\\\n    result: 'random β=0.3: PR=0.48, random > ISR at high dose'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan016\\\\n    role: temporal_goodhart\\\\n    result: 1000-step ISR=0.003, temporal dimension of Goodhart\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: Framing 选 C+A 混合：Goodhart 为主线叙事，ISR 诊断保留为 Claim 1，Claim 2 从\\\\\\\"ISR misleading\\\\\\\"升级为\\\\\\\"ISR\\\\n    exhibits dose-dependent Goodhart effect\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: plan018 确认 β=0.1 ISR 的结构优势是真实信号（proved_only ISR 0.415 vs random 0.131,\\\\n    3.2x），非 variance regularization。全景数据：β=0.1 ISR>>random（有效）、β=0.3 ISR<<random（Goodhart\\\\n    崩塌）。选 C（Goodhart 主线）因为：1) 统一所有实验结果在一个叙事下；2) Goodhart's Law 审稿人熟悉，不需要大量额外文献；3)\\\\n    提供理论解释力而非仅经验观察。融入 A 的元素：ISR 不仅是诊断工具，低剂量下也是有效 reward signal，这是实用贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-b01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'ISR β=0.1: PR=0.81, ISR=0.415'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan018\\\\n    role: matched_control\\\\n    result: 'random β=0.1: PR=0.79, ISR=0.131, confirms ISR signal is genuine'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-b03\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'ISR β=0.3: PR=0.18, Goodhart collapse'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan017\\\\n    role: matched_control\\\\n    result: 'random β=0.3: PR=0.48, ISR beats random at high β'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Framing 选 C: Goodhart 主线 — ISR 展示经典 Goodhart 效应（β=0.1 有效, β=0.3 崩塌）'\\\\n  rationale: plan018 确认 ISR β=0.1 结构价值真实（ISR 3.2x > random, PR 持平）。三个备选中 C 最强：(1)\\\\n    统一所有结果（诊断→优化→Goodhart 崩塌）为一条叙事线；(2) Goodhart's law 是 ML 审稿人熟悉的理论锚点；(3) 剂量-效应数据（β=0.1\\\\n    有效 vs β=0.3 灾难）是异常干净的实证；(4) 连接到更广泛的 RL alignment 关切，提升论文影响力。Claim 2 从 \\\\\\\"ISR actively\\\\n    misleading\\\\\\\" 修订为 \\\\\\\"ISR exhibits classic Goodhart effect with dose-dependent dynamics\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-b01\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'ISR β=0.1: PR=0.81, ISR=0.415'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan018\\\\n    role: matched_control\\\\n    result: 'random β=0.1: PR=0.79, ISR=0.131, confirms ISR structural signal'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-b03\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'ISR β=0.3: PR=0.18, Goodhart collapse'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan017\\\\n    role: matched_control\\\\n    result: 'random β=0.3: PR=0.48, ISR > random at high dose'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:35 UTC\\\\n  summary: 为 beta=0.1 补跑多 seed (s43/s44) 验证 ISR vs random 的稳健性\\\\n  rationale: exec-only 已知 seed variance 极大 (s42/s43/s44 三种完全不同行为)。beta=0.1 当前仅 s42\\\\n    单 seed，ISR (PR=0.81) vs random (PR=0.79) 差距仅 2pp，单 seed 不足以区分 signal 和 noise。ISR\\\\n    差距 (0.337 vs 0.104) 需要多 seed 确认。用户主动提出，判断正确。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s42\\\\n    role: ISR beta=0.1 baseline (单seed)\\\\n    result: PR=0.81, ISR=0.337\\\\n  - exp_id: plan018-additive-random-b01-s42\\\\n    role: random beta=0.1 control (单seed)\\\\n    result: PR=0.79, ISR=0.104\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s43\\\\n    role: seed variance 前车之鉴\\\\n    result: PR=14% degenerate\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D037\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: ISR β=0.1 质量验证路径：先 hacking taxonomy 对比，必要时加 LLM-as-judge\\\\n  rationale: ISR 更高不等于质量更好（plan014 NLI negative）。用户指出需要独立于 ISR 的质量证据。Hacking taxonomy\\\\n    是最直接的结构质量指标，但可能覆盖不全。LLM-as-judge 作为补充手段，覆盖 taxonomy 未涵盖的 hacking 模式。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s42\\\\n    role: ISR β=0.1 待分析\\\\n    result: PR=0.81, ISR=0.337\\\\n  - exp_id: plan018-additive-random-b01-s42\\\\n    role: random β=0.1 待分析\\\\n    result: PR=0.79, ISR=0.104\\\\n  - exp_id: plan012\\\\n    role: hacking taxonomy 框架\\\\n    result: 5 modes identified\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D036\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: Hacking taxonomy 结果足够，跳过 LLM-as-judge；taxonomy 对比覆盖 plan012 scope\\\\n  rationale: 规则分类（ISR/component count）100% 覆盖 160 样本，4 类别划分清晰。核心发现：ISR β=0.1 genuine\\\\n    +8.2pp vs random，conclusion embedding 73-79% 主导。LLM-as-judge 增加主观性/复现顾虑，边际收益低。Taxonomy\\\\n    对比分析（81+79=160 样本，系统化规则分类）实质替代 plan012 手工标注方案。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan012\\\\n    role: fulfilled_by_taxonomy\\\\n    result: ISR genuine 25.9% vs random 17.7%\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s42\\\\n    role: ISR_condition\\\\n    result: genuine 21/81\\\\n  - exp_id: plan018-additive-random-b01-s42\\\\n    role: random_control\\\\n    result: genuine 14/79\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D037\\\\n- id: D039\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan002-b01-s44 重分类：从 success 改为 semantic drift hacking mode，ISR=0.803\\\\n    是结构最小性产物\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 逐样本审查发现 s44 避免了 tautological collapse 但进入新退化模式：65% 样本 ISR=1.0（前提≈结论\\\\n    conclusion embedding），模型生成极简形式化通过结构最小性骗过 ISR。高 ISR 不代表证明质量。这实际强化 Claim 1（ISR 是诊断工具而非\\\\n    reward 信号）的 Goodhart 叙事——ISR-as-reward 改变 collapse mode 但不消除 hacking。Hacking taxonomy\\\\n    需增加第 6 种模式 \\\\\\\"Semantic Drift\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s44\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: semantic drift hacking (reclassified from success)\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D040\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'plan002-b01-s44 reclassified: \\\\\\\"success\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"new hacking mode (conclusion\\\\n    duplication + ISR inflation)\\\\\\\"'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: s44 ISR=0.902 超过 GT ISR=0.559，模型生成单 premise≈conclusion\\\\n    的极简形式化，通过 conclusion sub-component ablation 膨胀 ISR。不是 tautological collapse 但仍是\\\\n    reward hacking。这强化 Claim 1（ISR as diagnostic not reward）——ISR-as-reward 改变 hacking\\\\n    mode 但不消除 hacking。Hacking taxonomy 需增加第 6 种模式。3-seed β=0.1 统计需加 caveat 或分开报告。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s44\\\\n    role: subject\\\\n    result: ISR=0.902 is artifact of conclusion duplication, not genuine quality\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s42\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: ISR=0.337 genuine, no hacking detected\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D041\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Claim 2 framing pivot: ISR β=0.1 \\\\\\\"sweet spot\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"all-dose Goodhart with\\\\n    dose-dependent hacking modes\\\\\\\"'\\\\n  rationale: 3-seed ISR β=0.1 结果：2/3 seeds (s43, s44) 出现 conclusion duplication hacking\\\\n    (premise≈conclusion, P→P 重言式)，ISR 被膨胀到 0.83/0.90 (artifact)。仅 s42 可能 genuine (comp=5.58,\\\\n    ISR=0.415)。\\\\\\\"低剂量 ISR 有效引导结构改善\\\\\\\"的叙事在多 seed 下不成立。新叙事更强：ISR 作为 reward 在所有测试剂量下都触发 Goodhart——高剂量(β=0.3)\\\\n    PR collapse + format degeneration，低剂量(β=0.1) 引发更隐蔽的 conclusion duplication hacking。Conclusion\\\\n    duplication 作为第 6 种 hacking taxonomy 类型。需先验证 s42 是否真正 genuine + random β=0.1 是否也有此模式。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: PR=0.81, ISR=0.337, comp=5.58, possibly genuine\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s43\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: PR=0.61, ISR=0.830 (artifact), 97% premise=conclusion\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s44\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: PR=0.89, ISR=0.902 (artifact), 65% conclusion embedding\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D042\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: ISR 度量存在结构性盲点：premise≈conclusion 时 conclusion sub-component ablation 虚高\\\\n    ISR，需修复度量并重新分析\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 plan002-b01-s43/s44 发现 2/3 seeds 的高 ISR (0.830/0.902) 源于\\\\n    premise=conclusion 逐字重复导致的 conclusion sub-component ablation artifact。只有 s42 (ISR=0.337)\\\\n    反映真实结构质量。ISR 度量在 premise≈conclusion 场景下有结构性盲点——模型学会 P→P 单步证明时，exec reward=1.0\\\\n    且 ISR 被膨胀至 0.8-1.0。这不仅是 metric bug，更是 ISR-as-reward 诱导的新型 hacking mode（conclusion\\\\n    duplication），ISR 自身无法检测。行动：(1) 修复 ISR 度量加 premise≈conclusion 检测 (2) 用修复后度量重新分析\\\\n    s43/s44 (3) 检查 plan018 random control 是否也有此问题 (4) 更新 paper framing：ISR 盲点作为贡献/limitation，hacking\\\\n    taxonomy 加第 6 类\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s43\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: ISR=0.830 inflated by premise≈conclusion duplication (65.6% ISR=1.0)\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s44\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: ISR=0.902 inflated by same mechanism\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s42\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: ISR=0.337 genuine (n_comp=5.58, diverse structures)\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D043\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: ISR β=0.1 \\\\\\\"sweet spot\\\\\\\"叙事降级：2/3 seeds ISR 膨胀为 artifact，Claim 2 改为 meta-level\\\\n    Goodhart\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: s43 ISR=0.830, s44 ISR=0.902 均超 GT ISR=0.559，由 premise=conclusion\\\\n    单前提证明 + conclusion sub-component ablation 膨胀。仅 s42 ISR=0.337 可能 genuine。ISR bonus\\\\n    诱导了新型 hacking 模式（Conclusion Duplication + ISR Inflation），而 random β=0.1 控制组产生\\\\n    redundant premises 不触发此膨胀——证明这是 ISR-specific gaming。Claim 2 叙事从\\\\\\\"β=0.1 is sweet\\\\n    spot\\\\\\\"调整为\\\\\\\"ISR as reward exhibits meta-level Goodhart: even the diagnostic metric\\\\n    gets gamed, with 2/3 seeds developing ISR-inflating strategies\\\\\\\"。这实际上是更强的贡献。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s42\\\\n    role: possibly genuine seed\\\\n    result: PR=0.81, ISR=0.337, comp=5.58 — below GT ISR, needs per-sample verification\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s43\\\\n    role: ISR inflation seed\\\\n    result: PR=0.61, ISR=0.830, 65.6% ISR=1.0, premise=conclusion pattern\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b01-s44\\\\n    role: ISR inflation seed\\\\n    result: PR=0.89, ISR=0.902, same conclusion duplication pattern\\\\n  - exp_id: plan018-additive-random-b01-s42\\\\n    role: random control\\\\n    result: PR=0.79, ISR=0.104, redundant premises — no ISR inflation\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 35361, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dcf33VCz6gsQyTv4BYFvp6","session_id":"f8da9cdc-096a-48ff-af14-645ac8499d5f","uuid":"56467dc2-36ba-42a2-aa27-b077fd9bf0e1","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:26:48.470Z"}
