{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":498551,"duration_api_ms":639094,"num_turns":9,"result":"Review submitted successfully.\n\n**Summary:** Consolidated roundtable review scored **3/6 (Weak Reject)** with confidence 4/5.\n\nKey findings:\n- **Genuine strengths:** Clean ISR diagnostic, compelling seed-44 Goodhart paradox (optimizing ISR decreases ISR), honest negative-result framing, well-designed random control\n- **Critical gaps:** Statistical underpowering (3 seeds, 100 eval problems), narrow scope (1 dataset/model/solver/formulation), multiplicative reward formulation is an unablated confound, \"full-spectrum\" title overclaims with only 2 non-zero β values (β=0.3 on 1 seed only)\n- **Verdict:** Promising pilot study, but the gap to acceptance is primarily experimental breadth — needs 5-10 seeds, finer β sweep, alternative reward formulations, and a second dataset/model\n\nReport written to `dream_reports/dream_20260514T092544/worst/review_report.md`.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f8da9cdc-096a-48ff-af14-645ac8499d5f","total_cost_usd":2.839361,"usage":{"input_tokens":11,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59868,"cache_read_input_tokens":281857,"output_tokens":12369,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59868,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":240,"cache_read_input_tokens":65418,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6291,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6291},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":940,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00104,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":43,"outputTokens":26794,"cacheReadInputTokens":1460212,"cacheCrea